From c583827a354674180dc8856eb65aeb3f0afa5ee9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thor downstream maintainers
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Add disposable New Identity browser action
X-Downstream-Base: Chromium 151.0.7922.47
X-Downstream-Base-Commit: c583827a354674180dc8856eb65aeb3f0afa5ee9
X-License: Chromium BSD-style license (LICENSE)
X-Design: Unique memory-only OTR profile per action; existing
 BrowserManagerService and ProfileDestroyer own final-window teardown.
X-Shield-Contract: Non-primary OTR profiles do not run extensions. Thor's
 native network and Blink policy is the security boundary; the component
 extension is cosmetic/control UI only and is unavailable in identity windows.
---
